flowchart TD
  %% Client
  Client[Client (Postman or Frontend UI)]
  Client -->|HTTP Requests| Server[Express App (app.js)]

  %% Express Server Block
  subgraph Express_Server
    Server --> Routes[Router Layer]
    Routes --> AuthRoutes[Auth Routes]
    Routes --> DogRoutes[Dog Routes]

    AuthRoutes --> AuthCtrl[Auth Controller]
    DogRoutes --> DogCtrl[Dog Controller]

    AuthCtrl --> UserModel[User Model (Mongoose)]
    DogCtrl --> DogModel[Dog Model (Mongoose)]

    Routes --> Middleware[Middleware Layer]
    Middleware --> AuthCheck[authMiddleware.js]
    Middleware --> ErrorHandling[errorHandler.js]
  end

  %% MongoDB Layer
  subgraph MongoDB_Atlas
    UserModel --> UsersCollection[Users Collection]
    DogModel --> DogsCollection[Dogs Collection]
  end

  %% Testing Layer
  subgraph Testing_Layer
    TestSuite[Mocha & Chai Tests]
    TestSuite --> Server
    TestSuite --> MongoMock[(Mock or Test DB)]
  end
